---
Check source-data availability for a window and trigger top-up imports for missing ranges

Usage: vendo integrations refresh-source [OPTIONS] <integrationId>

Arguments:
  <integrationId>  

Options:
      --from <date>     Window start — ISO datetime or YYYY-MM-DD (default: 7 days before --to)
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --to <date>       Window end — ISO datetime or YYYY-MM-DD (default: now)
      --json            Output raw JSON
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo integrations refresh-source <integrationId>
  $ vendo int refresh-source <integrationId> --from 2026-06-29 --to 2026-07-02
  $ vendo integrations refresh-source <integrationId> --json
